  "details": "I'm deaf, so I use Sign language to communicate. I tried this beta thing where the users could use the webcam to show their facial expression, along with the hands. It's a neat thing, so I tried it to sign with my friends, but the webcam was struggling to pick up on my signs. \n\nSo I wonder if it would be possible to add an option for the second webcam, so the signing could be tracked better since having a second webcam would make a 3D space for the signing area?",
